# Display-only tail healing (`healTail`), the `remend` cases of vercel/streamdown
# plus ours. `=== name | heal`; the expectation is the healed SOURCE; an
# optional `--- display` section is the dump of parse(healTail(input)).
# A `@json "..."` line stands for the whole section (trailing spaces).

=== bold_open | heal
Text with **bold
--- expect
Text with **bold**
--- display
p "Text with " b"bold"

=== bold_open_underscore | heal
__bold
--- expect
__bold__
--- display
p b"bold"

=== italic_open_star | heal
*italic
--- expect
*italic*

=== italic_open_underscore | heal
_italic
--- expect
_italic_

=== bold_italic_triple_open | heal
***both
--- expect
***both***
--- display
p bi"both"

=== nested_open_inner_first | heal
**bold and *it
--- expect
**bold and *it***
--- display
p b"bold and " bi"it"

